(7490867, 1192949, 103032, '<td valign="top">Okay, this is cool.  My top pick so far.  I like the minimalist of the composition. Like the B&amp;W presentation.  Has a somber fall/winter feel, but not ominous.<br/> <br/>Looking at this longer, I think it strikes me because it feels familiar working those odd hours and driving home when no one else is on the road except that occasional car or lights from a business "over yonder."<br/> <br/>Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Okay, this is cool.  My top pick so far.  I like the minimalist of the composition. Like the B&W presentation.  Has a somber fall/winter feel, but not ominous. Looking at this longer, I think it strikes me because it feels familiar working those odd hours and driving home when no one else is on the road except that occasional car or lights from a business "over yonder." Hope this does well for you.', '2017-01-07 03:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7490868, 1192686, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the leading lines and the repetition.  However, I wonder if a lower angle and maybe customer and barber in maybe the third or fourth chair would have given this more impact.  But that''s my perspective...Still one of photos in this challenge that draw me in the most.</td>', 'I like the leading lines and the repetition.  However, I wonder if a lower angle and maybe customer and barber in maybe the third or fourth chair would have given this more impact.  But that''s my perspective...Still one of photos in this challenge that draw me in the most.', '2017-01-07 03:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
