(7491709, 1192934, 184603, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> And I can almost hear the guards saying stand back! I know precisely where you stood. Nice lighting. Was it still Agnes Martin show?<br/>Bump </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>They were shooing people to the right of us away from the ledge.  I had to take this quick.<br/> <br/>It was the Agnes Martin show - which we enjoyed.  It was hard for a 7 year old to get into modern art, but we had him counting her shapes and grid patterns and ended up having a good time.</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: And I can almost hear the guards saying stand back! I know precisely where you stood. Nice lighting. Was it still Agnes Martin show?Bump   They were shooing people to the right of us away from the ledge.  I had to take this quick. It was the Agnes Martin show - which we enjoyed.  It was hard for a 7 year old to get into modern art, but we had him counting her shapes and grid patterns and ended up having a good time.', '2017-01-11 10:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
